### Problem:
You are given a directed graph represented as an adjacency list and a starting node. Your task is to implement a breadth-first search (BFS) algorithm to traverse the graph and populate a set with all the nodes reachable from the starting node.

You are provided with the following code snippet as a starting point for your implementation:

